{"seq":2,"slug":"edi-message-transmission-protocols","title":"报文传输与回执协议对接：EDI/XML 报文构造、ACK 解析与状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/filing-cutoff-transmission-integration/edi-message-transmission-protocols","wordCount":2727,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"报文传输与回执协议对接-edi-xml-报文构造-ack-解析与状态机\">报文传输与回执协议对接：EDI/XML 报文构造、ACK 解析与状态机</h1><p>一艘从上海驶往洛杉矶的集装箱船计划 10 月 8 日 14:00 离泊。承运人系统 10 月 7 日 17:30 向 ICS2 发出 ENS，欧盟侧回了「报文已接收」的语法确认，业务回执却一直停在 <code>PENDING</code>，而状态机只认语法确认这一层，把 <code>SENT</code> 当成了 <code>ACCEPTED</code>，直到货代来电问「为什么这条船没有装船放行」才发现申报根本没通过。事故很典型：<strong>工程团队把传输层确认、语法层确认与海关业务层回执混成了同一个信号</strong>。本文只解决三件事：报文怎么构造、三层回执怎么解析、状态机怎么被装船时钟驱动；数据元素来源见同 hub 的 <code>../1_security-manifest-regime-model/3_data-element-taxonomy-mapping.md</code> 与 <code>../2_manifest-data-assembly-validation/1_manifest-data-sourcing-master-data.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层投递模型是三个独立的事实\">核心概念：三层投递模型是三个独立的事实</h2><p>安全申报最容易被低估的地方，是<strong>同一次提交会产生至少三种、有时四种彼此独立的确认</strong>，它们迟到顺序、可靠性与失败语义都不同；把它们压成一个 <code>success/fail</code> 布尔量，是绝大多数对接事故的根因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>回执层</th>\n<th>典型报文/信号</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>由谁产生</th>\n<th>失败含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>AS2 MDN、SFTP/HTTPS 4xx、MQ 投递报告、TA1</td>\n<td>字节是否到达对方网关</td>\n<td>中间网关/VAN</td>\n<td>重发即可，未进入海关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语法层</td>\n<td>X12 997/CONTRL、EDIFACT CONTRL、ack 分段</td>\n<td>报文能否解析成结构化记录</td>\n<td>海关前置解析器</td>\n<td>信封或段结构有错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务层</td>\n<td>CBP CUSRES（X12 355）、ICS2 业务通知、CBSA 响应</td>\n<td>海关是否接受这条申报</td>\n<td>海关风险系统</td>\n<td>需按错误码修正后重报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态层</td>\n<td>ACE 落库通知、ENS 关联舱单的通知</td>\n<td>申报是否挂到正确提单</td>\n<td>海关台账</td>\n<td>数据对但挂错对象</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键推论：<strong>语法回执为 <code>ACCEPT</code> 不代表业务回执为 <code>ACCEPT</code>。</strong> CONTRL 与 X12 997 只校验信封与段的语法合法性（控制号是否连续、段序是否符合目录、必填元素是否存在）。ISF 的业务错误通过 CUSRES 返回，其错误码是业务码（收货人要素缺失、HTS 与描述不匹配等），语法层完全看不见。每一层都必须保留独立字段与时间戳，而非折叠进一个 <code>ack_at</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报文构造-信封-控制号与交易集\">报文构造：信封、控制号与交易集</h2><p>构造阶段处理同一组机械问题：<strong>信封嵌套、控制号生成、交易集映射、值域与代码表对齐</strong>。以美国海运为例，承运人舱单走 AMS，进口商/报关行的安全申报走 ABI 上的 ISF 交易；两条路径报文形态不同，但对信封要求一致。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[内部货运模型&lt;br/&gt;Shipment/Cargo/BL] --&gt; B{目标制度}&#10;  B --&gt;|美国海运| C1[X12 309 舱单&lt;br/&gt;ABI ISF 交易]&#10;  B --&gt;|欧盟| C2[ENS XML&lt;br/&gt;ICS2 报文]&#10;  B --&gt;|加拿大| C3[CBSA EDI&lt;br/&gt;eManifest 报文]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D1[ISA/GS/ST 信封&lt;br/&gt;控制号 + 段计数]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D1&#10;  C3 --&gt; D1&#10;  D1 --&gt; E[上链前本地校验] --&gt; F[发送队列] --&gt; G[传输通道&lt;br/&gt;AS2/SFTP/MQ/AS4]\">graph TD\n  A[内部货运模型&lt;br/&gt;Shipment/Cargo/BL] --&gt; B{目标制度}\n  B --&gt;|美国海运| C1[X12 309 舱单&lt;br/&gt;ABI ISF 交易]\n  B --&gt;|欧盟| C2[ENS XML&lt;br/&gt;ICS2 报文]\n  B --&gt;|加拿大| C3[CBSA EDI&lt;br/&gt;eManifest 报文]\n  C1 --&gt; D1[ISA/GS/ST 信封&lt;br/&gt;控制号 + 段计数]\n  C2 --&gt; D1\n  C3 --&gt; D1\n  D1 --&gt; E[上链前本地校验] --&gt; F[发送队列] --&gt; G[传输通道&lt;br/&gt;AS2/SFTP/MQ/AS4]</pre><p>美国侧舱单类报文在 X12 交易集层面分工明确：<strong>309 = U.S. Customs Manifest</strong>（提单层级舱单）、<strong>310 = Freight Receipt and Invoice (Ocean)</strong>、<strong>315 = 装载/状态明细</strong>、<strong>322 = 码头作业活动</strong>、<strong>355 = 海关接受/拒绝响应</strong>（即 CUSRES）。交易集号来自 ANSI ASC X12 标准目录（<a href=\"https://x12.org\">X12 交易集目录</a>），海关侧实现约束另见 CBP CATAIR；功能性确认由 <strong>997</strong> 承担，只回答「语法是否可解析」。</p>\n<p>配载与箱状态这两类承运人附加要求的报文格式被明确列举（<a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/trade/automated/automated_systems/rail_sea/stow-plans-and-container-status-messages\">CBP：Stow Plans and Container Status Messages</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>船舶配载图（Vessel Stow Plan）</strong>：UN/EDIFACT <strong>BAPLIE SMDG v1.5</strong> 与 <strong>SMDG v2.0</strong>；</li>\n<li><strong>集装箱状态报文（CSM）</strong>：ANSI X.12 <strong>322 v4010/5010</strong>、<strong>315 v4010/5010</strong>，及 UN/EDIFACT <strong>CODECO</strong> 与 <strong>COARRI</strong>；</li>\n<li><strong>兜底条款</strong>：CBP 注明可在申请后自行裁量接受其它 CSM 格式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>构造层含义是：<strong>同一套内部模型要能投影到多个报文族</strong>。BAPLIE 表达贝位/箱位，CODECO/COARRI 表达进出闸与装卸事件，字段集不重叠；把箱状态塞进 BAPLIE 会语法层通过、业务层被拒。欧盟侧 ENS 走 ICS2 文档型报文，元素集与代码表由 ICS2 Trader Handbook 规定，与 X12 段结构无对应关系——<strong>映射要以「语义元素」为中间层</strong>。信封层三个常见缺陷：<strong>控制号复用</strong>（重发必须变化，否则网关按重复报文丢弃）、<strong>段计数不一致</strong>（会被 997/CONTRL 拒绝）、<strong>字符集越界</strong>（非 ASCII 未按声明字符集转义）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回执解析-把业务通知翻译成可执行动作\">回执解析：把业务通知翻译成可执行动作</h2><p>回执解析的产出不应是成功/失败，而应是<strong>一组结构化处置项</strong>：处置类型、错误码、出错元素定位、该错误是否可自愈。以 CUSRES（355）为例，要解析三层信息：<strong>关联键</strong>（靠控制号或申报参考号关联回原提交）、<strong>处置类别</strong>（接受、拒绝、需补正、有条件接受）、<strong>错误明细</strong>。欧盟侧 ICS2 回执沿用 ICS 的 IE 报文编号体系，编号与元素约束以欧盟委员会 ICS2 文档为准（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/ics2_en\">欧盟委员会：ICS2</a>）。</p>\n<p>解析时要特别处理<strong>多错误项聚合</strong>：一条 ENS 可能同时返回数个业务错误，逐个修正再重报比一次性归并修正再重报慢得多——每次重报都要重新排队并消耗时限预算。另一个必须显式建模的类别是**「有条件接受」与「待定」<strong>：它既不等于拒绝，也不等于放行（海关可能要求补充说明、或把申报挂入查验）；若状态机把它映射成 <code>ACCEPTED</code>，就出现本文开头那艘船的情形。解析层应把处置类别映射到</strong>有明确后续动作的枚举**，而非二值判断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置类别</th>\n<th>是否可自愈</th>\n<th>建议动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法错误（信封/段）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>修正信封或段结构后原样重发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>必填元素缺失</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>从内部模型补值后重发，计入重报次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值域/代码表错误</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>对照对方代码表转换后重发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联键不匹配（挂错提单）</td>\n<td>需人工</td>\n<td>核对提单/申报参考号，防止重复挂账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查验/布控</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>转入人工处置，不重报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝（不可补正）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>升级合规流程，评估是否变更申报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时限驱动的状态机\">时限驱动的状态机</h2><p>安全申报与普通报关最根本的差别是<strong>存在一个不可谈判的截止时钟</strong>。美国海运要求舱单与安全申报在外国港口装船前 24 小时提交（ISF 自 2009 年 1 月 26 日起施行，<a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/border-security/ports-entry/cargo-security/importer-security-filing-102\">CBP：Importer Security Filing 10+2</a>）；欧盟 ICS2 的 ENS 按方式有不同前置量。状态机因此必须是<strong>时限驱动</strong>的：停在中间态超过预算的实例都要主动升级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; DRAFT&#10;  DRAFT --&gt; BUILT: 上链校验通过&#10;  BUILT --&gt; SENT: 进入发送队列&#10;  SENT --&gt; TRANSPORT_ACK: 网关投递确认&#10;  SENT --&gt; SENT: 超时未确认&lt;br/&gt;换控制号重发&#10;  TRANSPORT_ACK --&gt; SYNTAX_ACK: 收到 997/CONTRL&#10;  SYNTAX_ACK --&gt; BUSINESS_ACK: 收到 CUSRES/业务通知&#10;  BUSINESS_ACK --&gt; ACCEPTED: 接受&#10;  BUSINESS_ACK --&gt; REJECTED: 拒绝&#10;  BUSINESS_ACK --&gt; PENDING: 有条件接受/待定&#10;  REJECTED --&gt; BUILT: 修正后重报&#10;  PENDING --&gt; ACCEPTED: 后续放行&#10;  PENDING --&gt; REJECTED: 后续拒绝&#10;  ACCEPTED --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; DRAFT\n  DRAFT --&gt; BUILT: 上链校验通过\n  BUILT --&gt; SENT: 进入发送队列\n  SENT --&gt; TRANSPORT_ACK: 网关投递确认\n  SENT --&gt; SENT: 超时未确认&lt;br/&gt;换控制号重发\n  TRANSPORT_ACK --&gt; SYNTAX_ACK: 收到 997/CONTRL\n  SYNTAX_ACK --&gt; BUSINESS_ACK: 收到 CUSRES/业务通知\n  BUSINESS_ACK --&gt; ACCEPTED: 接受\n  BUSINESS_ACK --&gt; REJECTED: 拒绝\n  BUSINESS_ACK --&gt; PENDING: 有条件接受/待定\n  REJECTED --&gt; BUILT: 修正后重报\n  PENDING --&gt; ACCEPTED: 后续放行\n  PENDING --&gt; REJECTED: 后续拒绝\n  ACCEPTED --&gt; [*]</pre><p>每个边沿都必须带时间戳，且<strong>判断「能否按时完成」要基于剩余时限预算，而非当前状态</strong>。设装船时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>load</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{load}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">load</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，法定前置量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>regime</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{regime}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">regime</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，传输与解析的观测延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{transit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，重报一次的往返为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>retry</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{retry}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则最晚成功收敛到 <code>ACCEPTED</code> 的时刻与剩余可重报次数上限分别为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>load</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>regime</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>load</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>regime</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>transit</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>retry</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{accept}} \\le t_{\\text{load}} - \\Delta_{\\text{regime}} - \\Delta_{\\text{transit}}, \\qquad n_{\\max} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{t_{\\text{load}} - \\Delta_{\\text{regime}} - t_{\\text{now}} - \\Delta_{\\text{transit}}}{\\Delta_{\\text{retry}}} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">load</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">regime</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">retry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">load</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">regime</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\max} = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，系统不应继续自动重试，而应触发人工升级——截止前已不可能通过自动重报完成收敛。这条判据必须写在状态机里，而非运维手册里：<strong>没有人会在凌晨三点记得去数剩余预算</strong>。若单次重报成功概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次尝试后至少成功一次的概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>succ</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{succ}}(n) = 1 - p^{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">succ</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 时三次尝试仍有约 2.7% 概率全部失败，所以真正的收敛手段是<strong>在构造层把可预防错误挡掉</strong>，而不是靠重试补救。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传输通道与幂等控制\">传输通道与幂等控制</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>回执能力</th>\n<th>常见场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AS2（RFC 4130）</td>\n<td>MDN 可同步/异步回执</td>\n<td>承运人、报关行直连</td>\n<td>MDN 异步时需处理两段确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SFTP/HTTPS 批量</td>\n<td>无内建业务回执，靠对账文件</td>\n<td>批量舱单、状态报文</td>\n<td>「上传成功」被误当「已受理」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息队列（MQ 类）</td>\n<td>投递报告 + 队列级确认</td>\n<td>企业内集成</td>\n<td>队列确认不等于海关确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AS4（OASIS ebMS3）</td>\n<td>带业务层回执的可靠消息</td>\n<td>欧盟 eDelivery 生态</td>\n<td>需正确配置签名与重传策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AS2 规范是 IETF <strong>RFC 4130</strong>，AS4 来自 OASIS ebMS3/AS4，并被欧盟 eDelivery 构件作为标准投递层（<a href=\"https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks\">欧盟数字构件：eDelivery</a>）。共同点是<strong>把「消息投递」与「消息处置」分成两次交互</strong>，状态机必须能接受「已投递但尚未处置」这个中间态。</p>\n<p>幂等控制是通道层的核心工程问题。加拿大 CBSA 的 ACI eManifest 允许商业数据通过 <strong>EDI 或 eManifest Portal</strong> 提交（<a href=\"https://www.cbsa-asfc.gc.ca/prog/aci-manif-ipec/menu-eng.html\">CBSA：ACI eManifest</a>），两条路径汇入同一台账，<strong>同一条提单可能被两个入口各报一次</strong>。系统必须维护「申报主键 = 提单号 + 制度 + 角色」唯一性，重发时携带与原报一致的业务键；与之相对，<strong>信封控制号必须每次不同</strong>——业务键保证幂等，控制号保证可追溯；混淆会造成网关静默丢弃或台账重复申报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性与对账\">可观测性与对账</h2><p>单条回执只解决「这一票怎么了」，运营层面还需要<strong>对账</strong>：在装船前的固定时间窗内，把「应当申报的提单集合」与「已 <code>ACCEPTED</code> 的提单集合」做差集，差集里任何一条都是潜在漏报或未收敛；对账要按制度分别做，因为 ISF、ENS、ACI 的提单集合并不相同。</p>\n<p>对账需要三类度量：<strong>收敛时延</strong>（<code>DRAFT</code> 到 <code>ACCEPTED</code> 的分布）、<strong>重报率</strong>（<code>REJECTED → BUILT</code> 转换占比）、<strong>错误码分布</strong>。第三类最有价值：若某错误码占多数，说明它不是个案而是构造规则问题，应回到映射层修规则。</p>\n<p>要避免的反模式是把 <code>SENT</code> 或 <code>SYNTAX_ACK</code> 计入申报完成率——这两个状态都不代表海关已接受，会系统性高估合规率并在真正的截止时刻掩盖漏报。<strong>完成口径只应包含 <code>ACCEPTED</code></strong>，<code>PENDING</code> 单独统计并设独立人工处置时限。ISF 非合规后果被 CBP 表述为经济处罚、更密集查验与货物延误（<a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/border-security/ports-entry/cargo-security/importer-security-filing-102\">CBP ISF 10+2</a>），对账差集不是报表数字，而是已进入罚则射程的敞口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>安全申报对接的工程本质是一个<strong>在硬截止时间前、跨多个独立权威系统的可靠消息收敛问题</strong>。三层回执必须分别建模，因为语法层的 <code>ACCEPT</code> 与业务层的 <code>ACCEPTED</code> 回答的是不同问题；状态机必须由装船时钟驱动，并在剩余预算归零时主动升级而非继续重试；通道层的业务键与控制号分工不可混淆；完成口径只应承认业务层接受。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"报文传输与回执协议对接：EDI/XML 报文构造、ACK 解析与状态机","id":"报文传输与回执协议对接-edi-xml-报文构造-ack-解析与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层投递模型是三个独立的事实","id":"核心概念-三层投递模型是三个独立的事实"},{"level":2,"text":"报文构造：信封、控制号与交易集","id":"报文构造-信封-控制号与交易集"},{"level":2,"text":"回执解析：把业务通知翻译成可执行动作","id":"回执解析-把业务通知翻译成可执行动作"},{"level":2,"text":"时限驱动的状态机","id":"时限驱动的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"传输通道与幂等控制","id":"传输通道与幂等控制"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性与对账","id":"可观测性与对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时限规则与截止时间建模：24 小时规则、装船前时限与倒排调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/filing-cutoff-transmission-integration/cutoff-leadtime-24hour-rule"},"next":{"title":"系统对接可用性、重试与降级：通道中断、幂等提交与兜底申报路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/predeparture-cargo-security-manifest-filing/filing-cutoff-transmission-integration/connectivity-outage-retry-fallback"}}